    '> **✔ THE KEYED TRUTH, AND THE GOVERNING IDEA OF THE WHOLE TOPIC: *"IT IS NEVER A DIAGNOSIS NOR A DISEASE."*** `L6` gives three whole slides to causes precisely because *stridor* names a noise. Writing it as a diagnosis is the same error as writing *"fever"*. **Hearing it starts the assessment: WHICH PHASE (site) · WHICH GRADE (urgency) · WHICH CAUSE (age columns).**',
