      { k:'step', t:'The operation, in this order', n:'Laryngofissure → close every mucosal tear so no cartilage is bare → reduce and fix (stainless steel wire, or miniplates) → restore the anterior commissure → stent if comminuted (grade 4)' },
      { k:'alert', t:'⚠️ EXPLORE WITHIN 24 HOURS', n:'After that the planes are oedematous, landmarks lost, granulation begun — and the functional result falls away sharply' }
